   "creation": "2026-04-17 12:14:38.893196",
   "default": "<p><strong>B) Commercial &amp; Technical clarifications:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Supply &amp; Installation of Used Ducted split AC Units.</li>\n  <li>6 Month warranty for the whole unit &amp; compressor.</li>\n  <li>Supply &amp; Installation of PI Mouth Piece.</li>\n  <li>PVC Conduits and accessories for CDP system.</li>\n  <li>Supply &amp; Installation of Copper Pipes &amp; rubber insulation.</li>\n  <li>Testing &amp; Commissioning of above system.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>C) Exclusions:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>All associated builders work, wall chasing, civil works, trenches, etc. in connection including foundations, etc.</li>\n  <li>Supply and Installation of Outdoor Unit.</li>\n  <li>Supply of any Electrical items and containments.</li>\n  <li>CDP line 1 met from the units.</li>\n  <li>Updated requirements of any local authority.</li>\n  <li>Insurance for any equipment, materials brought to site by us.</li>\n  <li>Third party for Testing and Commissioning.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>D) Payment Terms:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>100% down payment.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>E) Guarantee:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>The services installed by us shall be guaranteed by us for a period of 6 months from the date of handing over of the project.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>F) Insurance:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>It is understood that Contractors All Risk policy including coverage of our works will be arranged by the Main Contractor, fully by his cost. However, we shall arrange for our workmen's coverage as per local laws.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>G) Delivery &amp; Completion:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>To meet the Main Contractor's completion program.</li>\n  <li>We require minimum 3 days after receipt of down payment.</li>\n  <li>We will agree upon with you a detailed work program compatible with your overall project schedule.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>H) Validity:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Our offer is valid for 15 days from this date.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>I) Notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>The price quoted is exclusive of Taxes/VAT. Tax/VAT shall be charged/collected in addition to the quoted price as and when the same is implemented in UAE.</li>\n  <li>Any re-work due to change in the approved drawing/current scope will be considered as a variation from the tender quoted.</li>\n  <li>We are not responsible for the delay in the work due to the non-availability of site clearance. We are not liable to pay fines for such delays.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>J) Free Site Facilities:</strong></p>\n<p>We would require the following facilities provided free of charge by you.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Free water and Electricity for the erection, testing and commissioning of our services.</li>\n  <li>Site sanitary facilities for our work force during the course of the contract period.</li>\n  <li>Provision for crane/hoist for unloading and positioning of heavy items of equipment as per site availability.</li>\n  <li>Provision for site office, complete with utilities and secures lockable storage space for safe storing of tools and materials.</li>\n  <li>Provision for scaffolding for all high bay works and roof decking are required for the installation of MEP Services.</li>\n  <li>Protection of MEP Services from damages by others.</li>\n</ul>",
   "depends_on": null,
   "description": null,
